<quiz>
<question type="stack">
  <name><text>Finding the rate and the time</text></name>
  <questiontext format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>(a) {@nm@} saved Ksh \({@ksh(P)@}\) in a SACCO account that pays simple interest. After \({@dd(T)@}\) years the amount was Ksh \({@ksh(A)@}\). Find the rate of interest per annum.</p><p>[[input:ans1]] % [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p><p>(b) A chama lends Ksh \({@ksh(P2)@}\) at \({@dd(R2)@}\%\) per annum simple interest and receives Ksh \({@ksh(I2)@}\) interest. For how many years was the money lent?</p><p>[[input:ans2]] years [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</p><p>Give each answer exactly or correct to 1 decimal place.</p>]]></text>
  </questiontext>
  <generalfeedback format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>(a) The interest is the amount minus the principal: \(I = {@ksh(A)@} - {@ksh(P)@} = {@ksh(I)@}\). Then</p><p>\[R = \frac{100I}{PT} = \frac{100 \times {@ksh(I)@}}{{@ksh(P)@} \times {@dd(T)@}} = {@dd(R)@}.\]</p><p>The rate is \({@dd(R)@}\%\) per annum.</p><p>(b) \[T = \frac{100I}{PR} = \frac{100 \times {@ksh(I2)@}}{{@ksh(P2)@} \times {@dd(R2)@}} = {@dd(TT)@}.\]</p><p>The money was lent for \({@dd(TT)@}\) years.</p>]]></text>
  </generalfeedback>
  <defaultgrade>2</defaultgrade>
  <penalty>0.1</penalty>
  <hidden>0</hidden>
  <idnumber></idnumber>
  <stackversion><text>2026063000</text></stackversion>
  <questionvariables>
    <text><![CDATA[kgrp(n) := block([s, out, k], s: string(n), k: slength(s), if k < 5 then s else (out: "", while k > 3 do (out: sconcat("\\,", substring(s, k-2, k+1), out), k: k-3), sconcat(substring(s, 1, k+1), out)));
ksh(v) := block([c, w, f], c: floor(100*v+1/2), w: floor(c/100), f: c-100*w, if f = 0 then kgrp(w) else sconcat(kgrp(w), ".", if f < 10 then "0" else "", string(f)));
dd(v) := if integerp(v) then v else if integerp(10*v) then dispdp(float(v),1) else if integerp(100*v) then dispdp(float(v),2) else if integerp(1000*v) then dispdp(float(v),3) else dispdp(float(v),4);
ix: 1+rand(10);
/* Design: [P, A, T, P2, R2, I2]. Curated list, one seed per entry. Source: original. */
L: [[30000,37200,3,14000,9,5040],[52000,62400,2,22000,12,6600],[75000,93000,4,9000,15,4050],[16000,20480,4,36000,15/2,13500],[125000,155000,2,18000,11,2970],[64000,78400,5,50000,13,19500],[22000,27940,3,40000,17/2,10200],[90000,110250,5/2,24000,10,8400],[40000,52600,3,28000,6,4200],[56000,70000,2,13000,14,7280]];
E: L[ix];
P: E[1]; A: E[2]; T: E[3]; P2: E[4]; R2: E[5]; I2: E[6];
nm: ["Achieng","Kiprono","Wanjiru","Omondi","Nekesa","Mutua","Chebet","Barasa","Njeri","Hassan"][ix];
I: A-P;
R: 100*I/(P*T);
TT: 100*I2/(P2*R2);
/* diagnostics */
rA: 100*A/(P*T);
rT: 100*I/P;
rH: I/(P*T);
tm: 12*TT;
ti: P2*R2/(100*I2);
tH: I2/(P2*R2);
]]></text>
  </questionvariables>
